  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orubuga Ayi niruhambwa kandi niruhwerekerezibwa.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambira Yoswa ati: “Otatiina kandi otaterebuka, imuka ogende Ai hamu n'abasaija boona abarwani; omukama owa Ai mukuhaire omusingule, hamu n'abantu be, orubuga n'ensi ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubuga Ai na mukama warwo, noija kurukora nkooku wakozire Yeriko na mukama warwo; ebintu byona, n'ente zoona, nibyo otwale, nugwo omugabo gwanyu, oyesereke haihi n'orubuga enyuma yarwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yoswa yaimuka hamu n'abasaija abarwani baatoma ogwa Ai; yakomamu abasaija emanzi ab'amaani, yabatuma bagende ekiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabaragira ati: “Mwesereke haihi n'orubuga enyuma yarwo; mutaruga harubuga mukagenda hara baitu mwikale mweteekaniize; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyowe hamu n'abantu boona aba nyina bo, nitwija kwirirra orubuga. Abantu aba Ai obu baraija kuturwanisa nkooku baakozire kara, nitwija kwiruka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo batuhondere, okuhikya boona obubarakahwera kimu omurubuga; habwokuba nibaija kuteekereza bati ‘nibatwirukya nkooku baakozire kara.’ Nukwo turukwija kubairuka tuti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu kasumi ako, itwe obuturaba nitwiruka, bali nibatwirukya, mwimuke na mbere mweserekere, muhambe orubuga; habwokuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu naija kurubaha murusingule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obumuraamara kuruhamba, murwokye, muhikirize MUKAMA ekiyaragiire. Mwetegereze ebi ndukubaragira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yoswa yabatuma, baagenda nambere barayesereka, baikara hagati ya Beseri na Ai: baitu ekiro eki, Yoswa yakimara ali hamu n'abantu be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaimuka nyenkya yasorooza abantu be, baimukya baatoma ogwa Ai, beebembiirwe abakuru ba Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija boona abarwani abaakaba ainabo, bairirra orubuga, baateera orukande ha bukiizi obwa Burugaizooba obwa Ai, nambere hakaba hali ekihanga hagati yabo na Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakwata abantu nk'enkumi itaano yabasereka hagati ya Beseri na Ai, harubaju orwa Bugwaizooba obw'orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahe nukwo bagatekaniize bati, orukande orw'okubanza nurwo rwabaire Burugaizooba bw'orubuga, kandi abalinzi barwo baaba Bugwaizooba bw'orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama wa Ai obuyaboine eki, uwe n'abantu be ab'omurubuga baarahuka bwango, baagenda kurwanisa Abaisirairi, ha kasirimuko ka Araba; baitu atamanye nkooku hakaba haroho abantu abakaba bamweserekeriire kumurwanisa enyuma y'orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa n'Abaisirairi boona baayeyoleka nk'abasingirwe, bairuka nibatoma ogw'obukiizi bw'irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo abantu boona abakaba bali omurubuga, baabasorooza baije babahondere, obubaabaga nibahondera Yoswa, ntamanya nibeeyongera kugenda hara n'orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatabeho muntu noomu ayasigaire omu rubuga Ai rundi Beseri ataragenzire kuhambya Abaisirairi; orubuga bakaruleka rwonka rukingwiire rutaina ow'okurulinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo MUKAMA yagambira Yoswa ati: “Icumu eri okwasire lyolekeze orubuga Ai; habwokuba ninyija kurukuha.” Yoswa, icumu eryakaba akwasire yalyolekeza orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwakaba naagorra omukono ati, abantu abakaba beeserekere baimuka bwango, bairuka baataaha orubuga, baaruhamba, batabandaale baarwokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abaarugire omurubuga Ai obubaarozire enyuma, baarora orubuga nirucuuka omwika ogukaba niguhika omubicu; omukasumi ako, bakaba bataina magezi ag'okwiruka kutoma omuhanda gunu rundi guli, habwokuba Abaisirairi abairukire nibatoma ogw'irungu, bakakubuutuka kurwanisa abakaba nibabairukya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa n'Abaisirairi boona obubaaboine bataahi baabu abakaba beeserekere bamazire kukwata orubuga, kandi orubuga nirucuuka omwika, baakubutuuka baatandika kwita abantu ab'orubuga Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi baaruga omu rubuga baija kubarwanisa; habweki, abantu ab'orubuga Ai, bakarorra aho beehinguliriiziibwe Abaisirairi orubaju n'orubaju, baabaita boona, hatabeho noomu ayatabukire rundi ayairukire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omukama wa Ai Abaisirairi bakamuhamba, baamuleeta hali Yoswa ali mwomeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi obubaamazire kwita enzaarwa zoona ez'orubuga Ai, omwirungu nambere baabairukiize, boona bamazire kubaisa empirima, baakubuutukira orubuga Ai, abantu barwo nabo baabaisa empirima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abaisirwe kiro eki, abasaija n'abakazi omutwaro gumu n'enkumi ibiri abo boona bantu b'omurubuga Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa omukono gwe atagugarre enyuma, akaikara agugoroire okuhikya abantu boona ab'omurubuga Ai obubahwerekeriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ente zonka n'ebintu nugwo omunyago Abaisirairi ogu baatwaire, MUKAMA nkooku yaragiire Yoswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yoswa yayokya orubuga Ai, yarufoora kifuruka eky'ebiro byona, nkooku ruli na hati hoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama wa Ai yamuhanika hamuti, yaikaraho naalengiija okuhikya orwebagyo. Izooba obulikaba niritobera, Yoswa yaragira abantu bahanuule omutumbi gw'omukama wa Ai, baagunaga ha irembo ly'orubuga baagutuumaho entuumo y'amabaale enkooto muno; ekiroho okuhikya na hati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
