              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa akombekera MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Isirairi itambiro harusozi Ebbali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 20:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkooku Musa omuhereza wa MUKAMA yaragiire abantu ba Isirairi. Nkooku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabu eky'ebiragiro ebya Musa ngu: “Itambiro ery'amabaale agatarabaizirwe, omuntu agaatakatahoga kyoma”; niryo baahongiireho MUKAMA ebihongwa eby'okwokya, baatambiraho n'ebihongwa eby'okusaba obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omumaiso g'Abaisirairi boona, Yoswa nuho yahandiikiire ha mabaale kopi ey'ebiragiro Musa eyakaba ahandiikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 11:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi boona, abanyamahanga n'enzaarwa, hamu n'abakuru baabu, abalemi n'abacwi b'emisango baayemerra baroleriire Esanduuko y'Endagaano, omu maiso ga baanyakatagara Abaleevi abaagyetwekaga. Ekicweka ekimu eky'abantu kikemerra kitire orusozi Gerizimu amabega, ekindi, kyayemerra kiroleriire orusozi Ebbali, Musa omuheereza wa MUKAMA nkooku yaragiire okubanza, ngu basabire abantu ba Isirairi omugisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, Yoswa yasoma ebigambo byona eby'ebiragiro, n'ebirukubaza ha mugisa nahamukyeeno, byona ebyahandiikirwe omu kitabu eky'ebiragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatabeho kigambo na kimu hali ebi Musa ebiyaragiire, Yoswa eki atarasomiire ekitebe kyona eky'abantu ba Isirairi, abakazi, abaana, n'abanyamahanga abaikaraga nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
